    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/00be949684672568b8c9fa74158024c3.avif?t=1709944706\" /></div><br><br><strong>Crumbling </strong> is a VR rogue-like action adventure.<br>\u2605 Action-Figure-like controls. Only possible in VR!<br>\u2605 Challenging rogue-like fights. Looks easy, but isn't!<br>\u2605 Romping story with animated comics &amp; narrator!<br>\u2605 Detail-rich toy diorama worlds<br>\u2605 Mini Games, collectibles, and much more to discover!<br><br>Talk to the devs on <br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Action-Figure VR</h2><table><tr><td>In Crumbling, you control your character directly with your motion controller, as if it was an action figure in your hand. Unwrap your hero from its blister pack, wave it around and smash monsters with powerful attacks!<br><br>But observe your foes closely! Only if you anticipate their every move can you avoid their assault. Evade and counter at just the right moment to keep the upper hand in action-packed hack'n'slash combat.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/7df480dfb7455b9ce4be4878eeeebf7e.poster.avif?t=1709944706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/7df480dfb7455b9ce4be4878eeeebf7e.webm?t=1709944706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/7df480dfb7455b9ce4be4878eeeebf7e.mp4?t=1709944706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Comics</h2>Discover the story of Crumbling through animated and narrated comic books. Learn how the evil B\u00f6se Corp. stole all the magic from Mr. and Mrs Crumble in order to make their horrible monster toys come alive. Can you stop them and reclaim the magic? The fate of the Crumble's famous store is in your hands - quite literally!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/b4ea4485965a63f3ed68b633f54a66d2.poster.avif?t=1709944706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/b4ea4485965a63f3ed68b633f54a66d2.webm?t=1709944706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/b4ea4485965a63f3ed68b633f54a66d2.mp4?t=1709944706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock Content</h2>Reclaim the stolen magic and use it to revive all kinds of toys: New Crumblings, more theme worlds, comic pages, and collectible power ups! Discover the lovingly created toy worlds of Mr. and Mrs Crumble and enjoy all the details. Between the glass covers and the cardboard backdrops you set the stage and put the monsters of B\u00f6se Corp. in their place!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/a6f1676154a7b440cf0144f6302ec869.poster.avif?t=1709944706\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/a6f1676154a7b440cf0144f6302ec869.webm?t=1709944706\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1701870/extras/a6f1676154a7b440cf0144f6302ec869.mp4?t=1709944706\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></td></tr></table>",
